  "_comment": "Settings › Region: how dates and times are written, the one source for the region command (hypr/scripts/region) and the kit (Region.qml, Dates.js). The language stays English: month and weekday names come from Dates.js, not the locale. Patterns: d dd M MM MMM MMMM yy yyyy ddd dddd H HH h mm AP. order is how a typed date is read (dmy, mdy, ymd); a new region is one entry here, with a locale that glibc has.",
